# Cloudflare uploads the repo root as the website (wrangler.jsonc: assets.directory ".").
# Everything listed here stays out of that upload. Git's own folder must stay out:
# its pack files exceed the 25 MiB asset limit and made every build fail.
# data/ is NOT listed: assets/js/data.js fetches data/*.csv at runtime.
.git
.gitignore
.wrangler
node_modules
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.swp
/CLAUDE.md
/DEPLOY.md
/README.md
/build.py
/templates/
/tools/
/wrangler.jsonc
